       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. RDABENDHANDLER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TARGET-PGM PIC X(8).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
       EXEC CICS HANDLE ABEND LABEL(ERR-PARA) END-EXEC.
       EXEC CICS ABEND ABCODE('TEST') END-EXEC.
       CALL 'DEAD'.
